  "title": "Butter Mochi Cupcakes",
  "description": "Baking butter mochi in a cupcake pan makes this easy Hawaiian treat even chewier than before, for a beautiful mix between a cupcake and a muffin.",
  "authors": [
    "Rachelle Zhang"
  ],
